00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:47.180
Speaker 1: Some of this I see in in a very
what seems more like just unknowns about the

00:01:47.180 --> 00:01:48.180
data.

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:49.180
Right.

00:01:49.180 --> 00:01:54.600
Which is OK, when I go to the grocery store
