00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:31.320
And it was sort of like a social calculation
that that I made.

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:36.710
And now as masks are coming off, I've said,
you know, I was just traveling.

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:40.660
And where I went, people weren't wearing masks
and grocery stores.

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:41.780
So I didn't either.

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:45.590
But then when I got back, I stick my head
