00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:47.040
I mostly see masks.

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:48.120
I put my mask on.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:50.590
I have no medical reason why I'm doing that.

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:51.590
Right.

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:53.830
The CDC guidelines are I don't need that mask.

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:59.220
Is it in some way bad that I'm doing this
